    "detailed_description": "Flax Engine Tech Demo 2022 is a small demo application that showcases realistic scene rendering. New <strong>real-time Global Illumination</strong> rendering effect using DDGI algorithm simulates how the indirect light bounces through the world. This can be used in games and visualization products such as Arch Vis projects.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138130/extras/cce8c6843b4d78baf3f3d8f7a4b05bd2.avif?t=1729113745\" /></div><br><br>Use the input Controls list to learn how to control the light direction and toggle custom options such as lights, GI, FPS counter, or dynamically simulated ball physics.<br><br>Visit Flax Engine Website to learn more.",
